      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I’m honestly trying to understand how someone is missing the portal. You have the whole front and back of the portal now. Even walking backwards works because you no longer have to worry about accidental portal collisions.\nAre you by chance so used to running non stop through the portals? If you want to confirm all you need to do is stand in the portal, don’t go charging through.",
