      "value": "@{5a766b8a0868b44b53569ce4|full_name}: Okay, pretty sure you can overshoot then even without the confirmation. That’s just a limitation of the physics I’d say.\nA suggestion on top of yours might be to have it be a hold to travel so there is no accidental portal travelling from a distance. Or if the portal prompt does appear for a brief second maybe it can remain on screen for a set amount of time, user choice of course, fading away after a few seconds. I’ll upvote your post and see what happens.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
