      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've never gotten the portal prompt to show up.\n\nI replied to this canny about the issue. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1236-portal-prompt-not-visible-when-entering-portal\n\nI was told it was because I don't like staring at the mic icon so I have HUD turned off, but it would certainly be nice to even see the portal prompt. I have no idea how this feature is supposed to work. I turned it on by mistake.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
