  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-30T04:38:40.352Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The ask to portal entry is not very nice to use, because it's easy to overshoot the portal when in worlds with fast movement.  It would be better if either it stops you to ask, or you can select and confirm portal entry from far away.\n\nFar selecting (laser with QM out, having a prompt or selection in menu for it) would be better overall because then you don't have to run across the map to get to it, only to find it closing on you.",
